			"Message": "docs(Vine): Reformat README tables with consistent indentation and self-closing tags\n\nThe Vine README tables have been reformatted for improved readability and consistency. The top header table and sponsor/patron table now use uniform indentation, wrapped inline and block elements on dedicated lines, and self-closing <img /> tags instead of unclosed <img> elements.\n\nNo content or semantic changes were made—only whitespace, line breaks, and tag-style normalizations.",
			"SHA": "01e7658e603b7d08b3ea602683e39dc7ba0ac7cb"
		},
